WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Step 1: Open the Zoho API Console for your region, sign in with your Zoho CRM login, and click Get Started.

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Step 2: Under Choose a Client Type, find Self Client and click Create Now.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Step 3: Click Create, then OK in the pop-up to switch the Self Client on.

4
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Step 4: On the Client Secret tab, copy the Client ID and Client Secret into your card first.

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Step 5: Open Generate Code. In Scope, paste ZohoCRM.modules.ALL,ZohoCRM.settings.ALL,ZohoCRM.org.ALL exactly.

6
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Step 6: Set Time Duration to 10 minutes, add a short description, and click Create.

7
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Step 7: Pick ZohoCRM, then your Production org, and click Create.

8
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Step 8: Copy the code. Paste it with your region (us, eu, in, au, jp or ca) within 10 minutes.
